    "case_facts_html": null,
    "question_html": "<p>The solution of (p + 2)(p - 3) + (p + 3)(p - 4) = p(2p - 5) is:</p>",
    "options": {
      "A": "6",
      "B": "7",
      "C": "5",
      "D": "None of these"
    },
    "correct_option": "A",
    "answer_html": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> (A) 6 — Expand LHS: (p² - p - 6) + (p² - p - 12) = 2p² - 2p - 18. RHS = 2p² - 5p. Thus 2p² - 2p - 18 = 2p² - 5p ⇒ 3p = 18 ⇒ p = 6.</p>",
