    "question_html": "<p>A number consists of two digits. The digit in the ten's place is twice the digit in the unit's place. If 18 is subtracted from the number, the digits are reversed. The number is:</p>",
    "options": {
      "A": "24",
      "B": "84",
      "C": "42",
      "D": "63"
    },
    "correct_option": "C",
    "answer_html": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong> (C) 42 — Let unit digit = x, tens digit = 2x. Number = 10(2x) + x = 21x. Reversed = 12x. 21x - 18 = 12x ⇒ 9x = 18 ⇒ x = 2. Number = 42.</p>",
